        ]
      }
    ],
    "dataNote": "Only complete 18-hole tee sets with published Course Rating/Slope are included. Explicit combo/blended/hybrid tee rows are excluded. Sex-specific tee columns are merged only when their 18 hole-by-hole distances are identical; otherwise they remain distinct source tee sets. Meters are converted from published yards using 1 yd = 0.9144 m. QasGolfPro stores one main par/stroke-index row."
  }
}
